  "node": {
    "id": "ctkg:v3e-object-00ceeaf24576fc72410ab3ef",
    "canonicalType": "KnowledgeStatement",
    "label": "在超前校正设计中存在三个主要设计参数：(1) 截止频率 ωc，决定了带宽 ωBW、上升时间 tr 和调节时间 ts；(2) 相角裕度 PM，决定了阻尼系数 ζ 和超调量 Mp；(3) 低频增益，决定了稳态误差特性。",
    "aliases": [],
    "description": "In lead-compensation designs there are three primary design parameters: (1) the crossover frequency ωc, which determines bandwidth ωBW, rise time tr, and settling time ts; (2) the PM, which determines the damping coefficient ζ and the overshoot Mp; (3) the low-frequency gain, which determines the steady-state error characteristics.",
